  "title": "Liste des guides ALD en cancérologie",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"reco annexe sujage\">\n <div class=\"cadre-titre\">\n <div class=\"titanx\">Annexe - Liste des guides ALD en cancérologie</div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"content-item intro\" id=\"d3844e11\">\n <div class=\"title\">Introduction</div>\n <div class=\"content-subitems\">\n <div class=\"p puce\"> Ces guides sont disponibles sur le site de l'<a href=\"http://www.e-cancer.fr/\" class=\"lien\" title=\"http://www.e-cancer.fr/\" >INCa</a> et sur celui de la <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/j_5/accueil\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/j_5/accueil\" >HAS</a>.\n </div>\n <div class=\"p puce\">La liste ci-dessous présente les affections regroupées sous l'intitulé Guide ALD n° 30 « Tumeur maligne, affection maligne du tissu lymphatique ou hématopoïétique ».</div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e22\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e23\">Dermatologie</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e25\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1228381/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-melanome-cutane-revision-janvier-2012\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1228381/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-melanome-cutane-revision-janvier-2012\" >Mélanome cutané</a>, janvier 2012.\n </div>\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-tiret\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n Lire <a href=\"rc4043.html\">rc4043</a>.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e37\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e38\">Endocrinologie</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e40\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2010-07/ald_30_gm_cancer__thyroide_web.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2010-07/ald_30_gm_cancer__thyroide_web.pdf\" >Thyroïde (cancer de la)</a>, mai 2010.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e47\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e48\">Gynécologie</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e50\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_922979/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-cancer-invasif-du-col-uterin\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_922979/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-cancer-invasif-du-col-uterin\" >Col utérin (cancer invasif du)</a>, janvier 2010.\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2011-02/ald_30_gm_endometre_inca_has_web.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2011-02/ald_30_gm_endometre_inca_has_web.pdf\" >Endomètre (cancer de l')</a>, décembre 2010.\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2010-02/ald30_gm_k_ovaire_vd_2010-02-11_15-00-56_15.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2010-02/ald30_gm_k_ovaire_vd_2010-02-11_15-00-56_15.pdf\" >Ovaire (cancer de l')</a>, janvier 2010.\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2010-02/ald_30_gm_ksein_vd.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2010-02/ald_30_gm_ksein_vd.pdf\" >Sein (cancer du)</a>, janvier 2010.\n </div>\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-tiret\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n Lire <a href=\"rc4034.html\">rc4034</a>.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e77\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e78\">Hématologie</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e80\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2012-02/ald_30_gm_leucemies_aigues_adulte_web.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2012-02/ald_30_gm_leucemies_aigues_adulte_web.pdf\" >Leucémies aiguës de l'adulte</a>, novembre 2011.\n </div>\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-tiret\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n Lire <a href=\"rc4055.html\">rc4055</a>.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1096150/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-la-leucemie-lymphoide-chronique\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1096150/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-la-leucemie-lymphoide-chronique\" >Leucémie lymphoïde chronique</a>, juin 2011.\n </div>\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-tiret\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n Lire <a href=\"rc4057.html\">rc4057</a>.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2013-10/apald_lymphome_hodgkin_web.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2013-10/apald_lymphome_hodgkin_web.pdf\" >Lymphome de Hodgkin classique de l'adulte</a>, septembre 2014.\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2012-06/ald_30_guide_lnh_final_web_2012-06-11_13-25-17_16.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2012-06/ald_30_guide_lnh_final_web_2012-06-11_13-25-17_16.pdf\" >Lymphomes non hodgkiniens ganglionnaires de l'adulte</a>, mars 2012.\n </div>\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-tiret\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n Lire <a href=\"rc4035.html\">rc4035</a>.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1021524/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-myelome-multiple\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1021524/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-myelome-multiple\" >Myélome multiple</a>, décembre 2010.\n </div>\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-tiret\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n Lire <a href=\"rc4027.html\">rc4027</a>.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e127\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e128\">Hépatogastroentérologie</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e130\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2012-03/ald_30__guide_ccr_web.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2012-03/ald_30__guide_ccr_web.pdf\" >Colorectal</a> (cancer), janvier 2012.\n </div>\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-tiret\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n Lire <a href=\"rc3506.html\">rc3506</a>.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2011-10/ald_30_gm_k_estomac_web.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2011-10/ald_30_gm_k_estomac_web.pdf\" >Estomac (cancer de l')</a>, septembre 2011.\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2011-10/ald_30_gm_k_oesophage_web.pdf\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/upload/docs/application/pdf/2011-10/ald_30_gm_k_oesophage_web.pdf\" >Œsophage (cancer de l')</a>, septembre 2011.\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">Foie (cancer primitif du), novembre 2010.</div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">Pancréas (cancer du), novembre 2010.</div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e158\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e159\">Neurologie</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e161\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1005895/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-cancer-primitif-du-systeme-nerveux-central-de-l-adulte\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_1005895/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-cancer-primitif-du-systeme-nerveux-central-de-l-adulte\" >Système nerveux central de l'adulte (cancer primitif du)</a>, novembre 2010.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e168\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e169\">ORL</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e171\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"p\">\n <a href=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_892158/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-cancer-des-voies-aero-digestives-superieures\" class=\"lien\" title=\"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/c_892158/fr/ald-n-30-guide-medecin-sur-le-cancer-des-voies-aero-digestives-superieures\" >Voies aérodigestives supérieures (cancer des)</a>, novembre 2009.\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"deflibre\" id=\"d3844e178\">\n <div class=\"titlibre\" id=\"d3844e179\">Pneumologie</div>\n <div class=\"plibre\" id=\"d3844e181\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"lst-items\">\n <div class=\"item lst-puce\">\n <div class=\"lst\">\n <div class=\"llst\">\